# Early Hints: per-post hero-image "Link: rel=preload" rules are appended to
# dist/_headers (build output) by src/integrations/early-hints-preload.mjs.
# Cloudflare replays them as HTTP 103 once Early Hints is enabled for the zone.
#
# 2026-09: connect-src now also allows https://translate.googleapis.com.
# The reader tools "voice" tab uses it to translate the article chunk by
# chunk when a non-Sinhala reading language is selected. Remove this entry
# if that fallback is ever dropped from reader-tools.js.
#
# 2026-09: ExoClick ad network integration. script-src and connect-src now
# allow ExoClick's core, fixed ad-serving infrastructure domains so
# ad-provider.js, popunder1000.js, and the in-page fetch/XHR calls those
# scripts make (venor.php, vast.php, link.php, TCF consent checks) are not
# silently blocked:
#   - a.magsrv.com          main ad-provider.js host (all async formats)
#   - a.pemsrv.com          popunder / fullpage-interstitial ads_host
#   - s.magsrv.com          in-stream VAST tag host
#   - s.pemsrv.com          popunder syndication_host
#   - s.zlinkt.com          direct-link ad format host
#   - ads.exoclick.com / syndication.exoclick.com  legacy iframe.php hosts
#
# frame-src and media-src did not exist before this change (both fell back
# to default-src 'self', which blocks every ad iframe and every ad video
# element outright, even after whitelisting the scripts above). Ad
# creatives are served from advertiser/CDN domains that are not fixed and
# cannot be enumerated in a static allowlist, so both directives allow any
# https: origin rather than a maintained domain list - the accepted,
# standard trade-off for ad-monetized sites. script-src already carried
# 'unsafe-inline'/'unsafe-eval', so this does not materially change the
# page's XSS risk profile.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://a.magsrv.com https://a.pemsrv.com https://s.magsrv.com https://s.pemsrv.com https://s.zlinkt.com https://ads.exoclick.com https://syndication.exoclick.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://comments.wala-katha.workers.dev https://api.web3forms.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://translate.googleapis.com https://a.magsrv.com https://a.pemsrv.com https://s.magsrv.com https://s.pemsrv.com https://s.zlinkt.com https://ads.exoclick.com; media-src 'self' https: blob:; frame-src 'self' https:; frame-ancestors 'self'

# Cache lifetimes for assets served from our own origin. Astro hashes JS/CSS
# bundle filenames and site images never change in place (optimize-images.yml
# rewrites a .webp only when its content changes), so a one-year immutable
# cache is safe. The Cloudflare beacon script comes from
# static.cloudflareinsights.com and its cache lifetime cannot be set here.
#
# The footer "Watch Movies" popup opens teraboxpage.com in a new tab (its own
# X-Frame-Options blocks iframes), so it needs no frame-src allowance of its
# own - the frame-src added above exists solely to support ExoClick ad
# creative iframes, which is a separate, unrelated concern from this popup.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
